Taking this up commits one to the following. Conjectures carried, none established: the ambiguity reading inherited through the account; the negotiation-economy reading held at one remove — I have it only as quoted inside p.carry.0, so adopting anything that leans on it includes a commitment to re-verify it against the rival's own text if that becomes available, including its self-named local disconfirmation; the still-open fairness fork; and the single-sentence dependence the whole ordering rests on, that 'has started avoiding the conversations' in the original task is a fair description, under the single-source caution all three inputs carried.

Retained with inherited grounds and the obligation to defend them under challenge: the five-step probe order under least-buy-in-first (resting on the objection's non-attendance point as carried and the rival's ordering principle); the rule that every remedy arrives carrying its discriminating observation; co-authored records scaled to stakes (the contested-record argument); one lever at a time with observation gaps; expiry-and-review and explicit imbalance surfacing; the friendship-maintenance condition with conflict-migration as its early warning, including the standing caveats that migration is a noisy proxy and that refusal-type observations must not be recorded as character verdicts. Newly explicit ground I commit to keeping attached: the original task's changing-schedules fact as the basis for preferring seven-day in-the-moment allocation over standing rotas — dropping that ground leaves the week-sized deal under-argued against a simpler rota.

Proposed revisions, each optional and criticizable, offered with grounds but no certificate. (1) The exit generosity test as a precondition for scoring the exit observation: adopting it commits one to design any exit to be at least as attractive as engagement on the most sympathetic available reading of the avoider's position, and to score refusal of a shabby exit as evidence about the offer, not the avoider; its ground is the independent principle that choice is evidence only among live alternatives. (2) Declared neglect for the unowned commons: adopting it commits one to a dated, reviewable declaration naming the domain, its standard, and any overflow-absorber, and to treating failure to obtain even this as threshold-relevant data rather than reverting to quiet absorption; this is a partial answer to the admitted weakness in dropping silence-is-not-agreement, not a full one. (3) The class-change threshold — any two of: generous exit refused plus engagement refused across more than one cycle; person-focused dispute content on the migration probe; corroboration from flatmate three: adopting it commits one to stop the chore sequence when it trips, not escalate within it, and to revisit the calibration if it misfires; the specific counts are uncalibrated conjecture.

Placement clarification, carried as a constraint: the third-flatmate consultation gates only the avoider-directed steps; it is error-correction only, and is dropped if it cannot be structured so as to be unexperienceable as recruitment.

Methodological commitment about the carrying itself: this synthesis is offered as converged; taking it up includes not commissioning a further synthesis round absent new observation (specifically an outcome report from any attempted step), and treating any next carry as retention-first. A genuinely new objection or new material would defeat this stopping proposal; it is a rule about evidence, not a gag.

Rejections carried forward in unmodified form, with the obligation to argue against their revival: unilateral confirmation messages; a process-first one-to-one as opener; costless silence-is-not-agreement. No new rejections are added this round.

Unresolved problems that survive: the boundary conversation remains unscripted — the threshold says when to stop, not what to say; the commons is rendered less dispute-prone but not allocated; load-balance under fixed domains still depends on the review step being honest; and whether the asker's self-carried share is sustainable without resentment is an empirical exposure no available text settles.

Nothing here commits anyone to escalation, to hiring help regardless of cost, or to ending the arrangement. If my reading of the inputs is wrong, salvage first: the least-buy-in ordering, the every-remedy-carries-an-observation rule, and the exit generosity condition — the last most of all, because it rests on a principle independent of these sources and would survive their wholesale misreading.